msgid "1AB Stats"
msgstr "1AB Stats"

#. Description of the plugin
#: 1ab-stats.php
msgid "Cookieless visitor statistics with affiliate click tracking, heatmaps and an A/B test for read-next cards. No cookies, no stored IP addresses, all data stays on your own server."
msgstr "Besucherstatistik ohne Cookies mit Klickmessung für Partnerlinks, Heatmaps und A/B-Test für Weiterlesen-Karten. Keine Cookies, keine gespeicherten IP-Adressen, alle Daten bleiben auf dem eigenen Server."

#. Author of the plugin
#: 1ab-stats.php
msgid "Alexander Boeckmann"
msgstr "Alexander Boeckmann"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:63
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Statistik"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:72
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:293
msgid "You are not allowed to change these settings."
msgstr "Du darfst diese Einstellungen nicht ändern."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:105
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Übersicht"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:106
msgid "Read next and A/B test"
msgstr "Weiterlesen und A/B-Test"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:107
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:111
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Einstellungen gespeichert."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:133
msgid "Data retention"
msgstr "Aufbewahrung"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:134
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:138
msgid "days"
msgstr "Tage"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:135
msgid "0 keeps the data without limit. Otherwise older entries are deleted once a day."
msgstr "0 bewahrt die Daten unbegrenzt auf. Sonst werden ältere Einträge einmal am Tag gelöscht."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:137
msgid "Recognise returning visitors for"
msgstr "Wiederkehrende Besucher erkennen für"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:139
msgid "After this time the random value behind the visitor identifier is replaced. Older identifiers can then no longer be matched. 1 is the most privacy-friendly choice."
msgstr "Nach dieser Zeit wird der Zufallswert hinter der Besucher-Kennung ersetzt. Ältere Kennungen lassen sich dann nicht mehr zuordnen. 1 ist die datensparsamste Wahl."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:141
msgid "More affiliate link domains"
msgstr "Weitere Domains für Partnerlinks"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:143
msgid "One domain per line. Clicks on links to Amazon and eBay are always counted."
msgstr "Eine Domain je Zeile. Klicks auf Links zu Amazon und eBay werden immer gezählt."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:145
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:242
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-heat.php:199
msgid "Heatmap"
msgstr "Heatmap"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:146
msgid "Count reading depth, time spent and click positions per page"
msgstr "Lesetiefe, Verweildauer und Klickpunkte je Seite zählen"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:147
msgid "Only totals per page, day and device class are stored, nothing about single visitors. Open a heatmap from the list of most viewed pages."
msgstr "Gespeichert werden nur Summen je Seite, Tag und Geräteart, nichts über einzelne Besucher. Die Heatmap öffnest du aus der Liste der meistbesuchten Seiten."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:149
msgid "Proxy or CDN"
msgstr "Proxy oder CDN"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:150
msgid "My site is behind a proxy or CDN that passes the visitor address in the X-Forwarded-For header"
msgstr "Meine Seite liegt hinter einem Proxy oder CDN, der die Besucher-Adresse in der Kopfzeile X-Forwarded-For weitergibt"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:151
msgid "Only tick this if it is true for your site. Otherwise all visitors behind the proxy may be counted as one, or visitor numbers can be inflated by forged headers."
msgstr "Nur ankreuzen, wenn das für deine Seite zutrifft. Sonst zählen womöglich alle Besucher hinter dem Proxy als einer, oder gefälschte Kopfzeilen treiben die Besucherzahl hoch."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:153
msgid "What is counted"
msgstr "Was gezählt wird"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:153
msgid "Logged-in users, previews, robots and browsers that send \"Do Not Track\" are not counted. No cookie is set and nothing is stored in the visitor's browser. The visitor address is never stored."
msgstr "Angemeldete Benutzer, Vorschauen, Roboter und Browser mit „Do Not Track“ werden nicht gezählt. Es wird kein Cookie gesetzt und nichts im Browser des Besuchers gespeichert. Die Adresse des Besuchers wird nie gespeichert."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:203
msgid "no data for the previous period"
msgstr "keine Daten für den Vorzeitraum"

#. translators: %s: change in percent with sign, e.g. +12 %
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:208
#, php-format
msgid "%s vs. previous period"
msgstr "%s zum Vorzeitraum"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:225
msgid "Nothing counted yet."
msgstr "Noch nichts gezählt."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:232
msgid "Count"
msgstr "Anzahl"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:234
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:339
msgid "Visitors"
msgstr "Besucher"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:262
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:285
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Unbekannt"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:281
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-heat.php:209
msgid "Phone"
msgstr "Handy"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:282
msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "Tablet"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:283
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-heat.php:208
msgid "Computer"
msgstr "Computer"

#. translators: %d: number of days
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:332
#, php-format
msgid "%d day"
msgid_plural "%d days"
msgstr[0] "%d Tag"
msgstr[1] "%d Tage"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:338
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:373
msgid "Page views"
msgstr "Seitenaufrufe"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:340
msgid "Affiliate link clicks"
msgstr "Klicks auf Partnerlinks"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:353
msgid "Most viewed pages"
msgstr "Meistbesuchte Seiten"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:353
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:357
msgid "Page"
msgstr "Seite"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:354
msgid "Where visitors come from"
msgstr "Woher die Besucher kommen"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:354
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Website"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:355
msgid "Countries"
msgstr "Länder"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:355
msgid "Country"
msgstr "Land"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:356
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Geräte"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:356
msgid "Device"
msgstr "Gerät"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:357
msgid "Affiliate link clicks by page"
msgstr "Klicks auf Partnerlinks je Seite"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:358
msgid "Affiliate link clicks by target"
msgstr "Klicks auf Partnerlinks je Ziel"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:358
msgid "Target"
msgstr "Ziel"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:361
msgid "Visitors are counted per day. Someone who comes on two days counts twice in the total. Countries are estimated from the time zone and language of the browser, not from the address."
msgstr "Besucher werden je Tag gezählt. Wer an zwei Tagen kommt, zählt in der Summe zweimal. Länder werden aus Zeitzone und Sprache des Browsers geschätzt, nicht aus der Adresse."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:379
msgid "Direct or unknown"
msgstr "Direkt oder unbekannt"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:397
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:398
msgid "Page views per day"
msgstr "Seitenaufrufe je Tag"

#. translators: 1: date, 2: page views, 3: visitors, 4: affiliate link clicks
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:404
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s: %2$s page views, %3$s visitors, %4$s affiliate link clicks"
msgstr "%1$s: %2$s Seitenaufrufe, %3$s Besucher, %4$s Klicks auf Partnerlinks"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:411
msgid "at most per day"
msgstr "höchstens je Tag"

#. translators: 1: number of page views, 2: number of days
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-heat.php:201
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s page views in the last %2$s days"
msgstr "%1$s Seitenaufrufe in den letzten %2$s Tagen"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-heat.php:202
msgid "Stripes: blue = read briefly, red = read for long. Dots: clicks."
msgstr "Streifen: blau = kurz gelesen, rot = lange gelesen. Punkte: Klicks."

#. translators: 1: share of visitors in percent, 2: seconds
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-heat.php:204
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s %% reach this · %2$s s on average"
msgstr "%1$s %% kommen bis hier · im Schnitt %2$s s"

#. translators: %s: number of clicks
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-heat.php:206
#, php-format
msgid "%s clicks"
msgstr "%s Klicks"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-heat.php:207
msgid "All"
msgstr "Alle"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-heat.php:210
msgid "Only little data so far."
msgstr "Noch wenige Daten."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:59
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:333
msgid "Read next"
msgstr "Weiterlesen"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:273
msgid "Too early to say. Wait until each variant has at least 100 page views."
msgstr "Noch zu früh. Warte, bis jede Variante mindestens 100 Seitenaufrufe hat."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:282
msgid "Variant B is ahead, and a difference this large is very unlikely to be chance."
msgstr "Variante B liegt vorn, und ein so großer Unterschied ist sehr wahrscheinlich kein Zufall."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:283
msgid "Variant A is ahead, and a difference this large is very unlikely to be chance."
msgstr "Variante A liegt vorn, und ein so großer Unterschied ist sehr wahrscheinlich kein Zufall."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:285
msgid "No clear winner yet. The difference could still be chance. Let the test run longer."
msgstr "Noch kein klarer Sieger. Der Unterschied kann noch Zufall sein. Lass den Test länger laufen."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:333
msgid "Heading"
msgstr "Überschrift"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:334
msgid "Look"
msgstr "Aussehen"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:335
msgid "Cards with image"
msgstr "Karten mit Bild"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:336
msgid "Plain list of links"
msgstr "Einfache Linkliste"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:337
msgid "Place"
msgstr "Platz"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:338
msgid "At the end of the article"
msgstr "Am Ende des Artikels"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:339
msgid "In the middle of the article"
msgstr "In der Mitte des Artikels"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:351
msgid "Read-next cards"
msgstr "Weiterlesen-Karten"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:352
msgid "Show related articles below every post"
msgstr "Verwandte Artikel unter jedem Beitrag zeigen"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:353
msgid "Number of articles"
msgstr "Anzahl der Artikel"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:354
msgid "Articles are chosen by shared tags and categories. Search engines and visitors without JavaScript always get variant A at the end of the article."
msgstr "Die Artikel werden nach gemeinsamen Schlagwörtern und Kategorien gewählt. Suchmaschinen und Besucher ohne JavaScript bekommen immer Variante A am Ende des Artikels."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:357
msgid "Variant A"
msgstr "Variante A"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:359
msgid "Variant B"
msgstr "Variante B"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:361
msgid "Run the A/B test: half of the page views get variant B"
msgstr "A/B-Test laufen lassen: Die Hälfte der Seitenaufrufe bekommt Variante B"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:363
msgid "The variant is drawn by chance for every page view, in the visitor's browser. Nothing is stored there, and only daily totals reach your server."
msgstr "Die Variante wird bei jedem Seitenaufruf im Browser des Besuchers ausgelost. Dort wird nichts gespeichert, und deinen Server erreichen nur Tagessummen."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:368
msgid "Test result"
msgstr "Testergebnis"

#. translators: %s: date
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:371
#, php-format
msgid "Counting since %s."
msgstr "Gezählt wird seit %s."

#. translators: %s: date
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:371
msgid "The test is running."
msgstr "Der Test läuft."

#. translators: %s: date
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:371
msgid "The test is stopped."
msgstr "Der Test ist angehalten."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:373
msgid "Variant"
msgstr "Variante"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:373
msgid "Box seen"
msgstr "Box gesehen"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:373
msgid "Clicks"
msgstr "Klicks"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:373
msgid "Click rate"
msgstr "Klickrate"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:373
msgid "Likely range"
msgstr "Wahrscheinlicher Bereich"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:383
msgid "Click rate = clicks on the box divided by page views. The likely range shows where the true rate lies with 95 % confidence; it narrows as more visitors come."
msgstr "Klickrate = Klicks auf die Box geteilt durch Seitenaufrufe. Der wahrscheinliche Bereich zeigt, wo die wahre Rate mit 95 % Sicherheit liegt. Er wird enger, je mehr Besucher kommen."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:384
msgid "Keep A and end the test"
msgstr "A behalten und Test beenden"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:385
msgid "Use B from now on and end the test"
msgstr "Ab jetzt B verwenden und Test beenden"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-next.php:386
msgid "Start a new test from zero"
msgstr "Neuen Test bei null starten"
